## The idea

A cat labelled as a dog is believable. A cat labelled as a truck is not. FBPLF flips labels toward classes that sit close in feature space, so the poison looks like natural confusion.

## Why it matters

Defences that look for updates far from the crowd miss it, because the poisoned updates stay close to honest ones.
